    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TropTopia is a 2D single-player and local co-op game where you make your way through levels filled with obstacles and enemies trying to stop you from collecting all the fruits. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features awesome mechanics such as wall jump, wall slide, double jump and coyote jump! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/c5afd25ed44f50f3ec1b12d12f7fdc62.poster.avif?t=1738081668\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/c5afd25ed44f50f3ec1b12d12f7fdc62.webm?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/c5afd25ed44f50f3ec1b12d12f7fdc62.mp4?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TropTopia even has a skin selection menu where you buy skins with the fruits you have collected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/974e8bb0a1c100f05192c2b77a131e70.poster.avif?t=1738081668\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/974e8bb0a1c100f05192c2b77a131e70.webm?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/974e8bb0a1c100f05192c2b77a131e70.mp4?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TropTopia also offers 3 difficultys for those who want a challange!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/b37b2a124905431a3bda7f6b4b5c7cef.poster.avif?t=1738081668\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/b37b2a124905431a3bda7f6b4b5c7cef.webm?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/b37b2a124905431a3bda7f6b4b5c7cef.mp4?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TropTopia is a 2D single-player and local co-op game where you make your way through levels filled with obstacles and enemies trying to stop you from collecting all the fruits. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features awesome mechanics such as wall jump, wall slide, double jump and coyote jump! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/c5afd25ed44f50f3ec1b12d12f7fdc62.poster.avif?t=1738081668\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/c5afd25ed44f50f3ec1b12d12f7fdc62.webm?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/c5afd25ed44f50f3ec1b12d12f7fdc62.mp4?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TropTopia even has a skin selection menu where you buy skins with the fruits you have collected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/974e8bb0a1c100f05192c2b77a131e70.poster.avif?t=1738081668\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/974e8bb0a1c100f05192c2b77a131e70.webm?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/974e8bb0a1c100f05192c2b77a131e70.mp4?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TropTopia also offers 3 difficultys for those who want a challange!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/b37b2a124905431a3bda7f6b4b5c7cef.poster.avif?t=1738081668\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/b37b2a124905431a3bda7f6b4b5c7cef.webm?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285240/extras/b37b2a124905431a3bda7f6b4b5c7cef.mp4?t=1738081668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "TropTopia is a single-player and local co-op 2D platformer where you make your way through enemy and trap filled levels. Your goal is to collect every fruit in every level. Each level is timed, and you can track your best times in the level select menu for an extra challenge!",
